nch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,What...Comment: 0,0:37:29.20,0:37:30.17,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,is this?!Comment: 0,0:37:30.87,0:37:34.79,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dreamy... taste?Comment: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:34.79,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,Flower! Flower!Comment: 0,0:37:34.79,0:37:38.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's something that's beyond my wildest dreams!Comment: 0,0:37:38.97,0:37:42.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,I can't even find the words to describe it!Comment: 0,0:37:42.97,0:37:44.89,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,What? What?Comment: 0,0:37:44.89,0:37:46.93,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,What's this flavor?Comment: 0,0:37:46.93,0:37:50.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's making rotten puppies start dancing!Comment: 0,0:37:50.94,0:37:53.91,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,The flavor is concentrated like...Comment: 0,0:37:53.91,0:37:59.88,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,A pet cemetery!Comment: 0,0:38:10.87,0:38:13.01,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's sweet!Comment: 0,0:38:11.96,0:38:13.01,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's sweet.Comment: 0,0:38:13.01,0:38:15.05,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's milky!Comment: 0,0:38:13.87,0:38:15.89,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's milky!Comment: 0,0:38:15.05,0:38:19.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's very rich and...Comment: 0,0:38:17.01,0:38:21.18,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's very rich and...Comment: 0,0:38:22.18,0:38:24.98,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,risky!Comment: 0,0:38:31.06,0:38:36.98,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Look! Yes, it's a big fuss!Comment: 0,0:38:35.02,0:38:36.98,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,Ship! Ship!Comment: 0,0:38:36.98,0:38:46.42,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's like when you throw a bomb into an amusement park!Comment: 0,0:38:49.99,0:38:52.07,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Like your stomach is having...Comment: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:57.13,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,A big ceremonyComment: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:06.76,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hey, Mother...Comment: 0,0:39:06.76,0:39:15.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Can you taste this overflowing happy sweetness?Comment: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:20.27,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Oh, yeah!Comment: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:24.71,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's the flavor of happiness...Comment: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:29.99,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,from back then!Comment: 0,0:39:36.96,0:39:45.01,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's eat again together someday!Comment: 0,0:39:45.01,0:39:46.87,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's sweet!Comment: 0,0:39:45.93,0:39:48.16,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's sweetComment: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:48.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's milky!Comment: 0,0:39:48.32,0:39:50.53,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's milky!Comment: 0,0:39:48.97,0:39:56.00,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's very rich and...Comment: 0,0:39:51.14,0:39:56.52,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's very rich and...Comment: 0,0:39:56.52,0:39:59.44,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,risky!Comment: 0,0:40:13.24,0:40:17.04,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hey Mother, do you think...Comment: 0,0:40:17.04,0:40:19.12,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,I can do this?Comment: 0,0:40:20.94,0:40:25.21,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Everyone's happy!Comment: 0,0:40:25.21,0:40:28.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's a peaceful utopia!Comment: 0,0:40:28.94,0:40:37.13,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It doesn't discriminate by race!Comment: 0,0:40:37.13,0:40:44.43,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,If you try to leave, I'll kill you though...!Comment: 0,0:40:44.43,0:40:48.91,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's a devilish contract!Comment: 0,0:40:48.91,0:40:53.07,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,The peaceful Totto Land!Comment: 0,0:40:53.07,0:40:56.82,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,We're all family!Comment: 0,0:40:56.82,0:41:01.84,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,The gentle queen...Comment: 0,0:41:02.62,0:41:03.95,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Big Mom!Comment: 0,0:41:16.93,0:41:19.04,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It was delicious.Comment: 0,0:41:19.04,0:41:21.63,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Thank you for the meal!Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.65,0:01:43.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:51.79,Main,,0,0,0,,There's not even a scratch on them!Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with them?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:02:00.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Take the injured guy and get off of this island already.Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:03.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't need you here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:04.99,Main,,0,0,0,,They set us up.Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:07.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll make them pay!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:12.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This whole island is Germa 66's target, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:14.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:18.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they really modified humans with iron skins?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:19.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring me a bazooka!Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.65,0:02:26.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:30.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that you were all dead! How did you survive?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.61,0:02:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand soldiers led by Nusstorte took down your kingdom!Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:43.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some flies swarmed around us, but we swatted them down and dumped them into the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:45.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:49.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-This is Mont d'Or! Answer me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:53.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Nusstorte! Please answer!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Basskarte! Big Brother Dosmarche!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:03:00.95,Main,,0,0,0,,If anyone's there... answer me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Just as I feared, unexpected things have continued to happen...Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,including Pekoms' betrayal-vous plaît!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:14.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did Germa's fleet appear at Cacao Island-noir?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What were you fools going to do with our scientific technology?Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:21.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You couldn't do a thing with it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:25.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Hurry and go!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:29.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Snack and the others are under assault by Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we help them?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:41.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get distracted by that! We've gotta focus on Straw Hat's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:44.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell that to all ships around the island!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Mont d'Or and everyone else... Germa must've outsmarted them!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:55.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You were outsmarted too, Brother Daifuku.Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Tsk! But I fought hard to catch up to you!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:04.46,Captions,,0,0,10,,Nuts Island - Peanuts TownDialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:07.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's hunger tantrum hasn't stopped yet!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:10.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We live in an Emperor's territory...Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:12.94,Main,,0,0,0,,where we're supposed to be protected in exchange for our lifespan.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:16.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the queen destroyed this place.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:22.57,Captions,,0,0,10,,Beany-Bean Town - Munchie IslandDialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:19.57,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way... to rebake the wedding cake...Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,that the famous Streusen-sama took days to make!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Even Pudding-sama won't be able to remake it in a mere several hours.Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:34.37,Captions,,0,0,5,,Table Town - Cutlery IslandDialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:34.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake Mama craves...Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We should prepare to evacuate!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:44.13,Captions,,0,0,10,,Sherbet Town - Ice Cream IslandDialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:45.87,Main,,0,0,5,,Let's get out of here before Mama arrives!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:47.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is Mama right now?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:49.15,Main,,0,0,0,,On Puffs Island!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,It's governed by the Minister of Puffs, Chiffon-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:55.72,Main,,0,0,0,,The hungry Mama is coming to this island!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:57.40,Captions,,0,10,10,,Puffs IslandDialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing will stop her!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:02.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did she bring the cake here?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:13.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:19.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think about Germa? Are they friends or foes?Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,They could've escaped already. Why would they bother helping us just for now?Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.73,0:05:29.48,Main,,0,0,0,,But... they're only helping us for now, right? How can we trust them?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:32.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Maybe Reiju-san came to show me her panties...Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:39.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:42.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:46.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji! This is the closest we can get to the island!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! Sail by the harbor at full speed!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get there while you're passing by!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:55.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun! How's Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:06:00.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I got him! I don't have time to talk now! I'm counting on you, Nami-san!Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:00.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jinbe! To starboard!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,To starboard!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:14.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You can do it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Crush Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did Black Leg go?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't see because of the dust!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:14.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right... We cannot let him get away, no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is the one person we cannot forgive!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:30.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He didn't escape from Big Brother Katakuri using dirty tricks...Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sister Brûlée?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:38.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna know what really happened in the Mirro-world?Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Perfect!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:47.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The strongest and best in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Our big brother, Katakuri...Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Big brother...Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.49,0:08:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,lost to Straw Hat Luffy!!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:29.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Katakuri...Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:32.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Your legendary undefeated record...Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:36.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,was broken by that pipsqueak?Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:41.85,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way our brother would lose!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:48.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri-sama cannot be defeated!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:53.77,Main,,0,0,0,,He must've used some kind of dirty trick! That's unforgivable!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Fill him with lead!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:08.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut him into pieces!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:18.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Smash Straw Hat Luffy to dust!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:40.28,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you escape, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:00.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Kill him, Big Brother Oven!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sparking...Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:23.59,Main,,0,0,0,,...Valkyrie!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:23.96,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:24.01,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:24.05,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.05,0:10:24.09,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:24.22,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:24.47,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.51,0:10:24.55,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:24.92,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:24.97,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:25.01,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:25.93,Main,,0,0,0,,V A L K Y R I EDialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:23.96,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:24.01,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:24.05,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.05,0:10:24.09,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:24.22,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:24.47,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.51,0:10:24.55,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:24.84,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:24.92,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:24.97,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:25.09,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:25.93,Main,,0,0,0,,S P A R K I N GDialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:32.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ichiji?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Take off, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.39,0:10:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Oven! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand him over!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:54.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:56.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take you down again-yu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Winch Guillotine!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:20.05,Main,,0,0,0,,WINCH GUILLOTINEDialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,WINCH GUILLOTINEDialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,WINCH GUILLOTINEDialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,WINCH GUILLOTINEDialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,WINCH GUILLOTINEDialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:22.72,Main,,0,0,0,,WINCH GUILLOTINEDialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yonji?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You're such an eyesore!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! He’s above the roofs!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:06.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to Katakuri-sama?! Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll be filled with holes at this speed.Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:26.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Niji!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:29.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:34.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Lightspeed Sword!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:45.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Henry... Blazer!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:44.15,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:44.24,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:44.53,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:44.61,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:44.66,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:44.70,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:44.74,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:45.24,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:45.36,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:45.45,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,H E N R YDialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:44.15,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:44.24,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:44.53,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:44.61,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:44.66,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:44.70,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:44.74,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:45.01,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:45.06,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:45.20,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:45.24,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:45.32,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,B L A Z E RDialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oven-sama! Straw Hat Luffy is going to escape the town!Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Escape the town?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:12.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, failure!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:18.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Snack! Brownie! Joconde!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:21.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot them down at the harbor!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.09,Main,,0,0,0,,They're coming towards you!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:25.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Isn't someone talking to us through the Transponder Snail?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I can make it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:36.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him go any further! Prepare tear gas canisters!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,We should just take away his ability to fly!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay with us!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:58.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:02.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:07.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Those who hurt my little brother...Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive them!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.15,0:14:15.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If I can... escape...Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:19.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,here in the East Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:26.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll never...Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:29.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,have to see...Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Father's face again, right?Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:41.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Pink Hornet!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.06,0:14:48.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Straw Hat! Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:55.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You're really a high-maintenance brother.Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't ever let him go!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:05.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji! You're a boy! Stop crying already!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:10.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen! Don't ever come back here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:10.93,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:22.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!!Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:32.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Sanji... My little brother who is the kindest person in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Reiju!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:37.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:16:02.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat got off of the island! Fleet, come in!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:16.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Here he comes, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:20.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji is carrying Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew Sanji could do it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:26.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see it now, Luffy! It's the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:37.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Is dinner ready yet, Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:43.92,Captions,,0,0,235,,Mont d'Or's Tactical Operations Center Sweet City - Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:48.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Please respond! How's Mama doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,And what about Bege?! And the cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Depending on what you say, things might get even crazier on Cacao Island, Brother Peros!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:59.98,Captions,,0,0,10,,At Sea - Big Mom's SideDialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:59.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Please respond, Big Bro Peros!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:02.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.99,0:17:08.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I still have my eyes on Mama, Bege, and the others!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:11.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong, Brother Peros?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:18.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Mont d'Or! This is Bavarois!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:24.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros left his wound untreated for too long, so he's losing his strength!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Now isn't the time to worry about that... lick!Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me that!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:38.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We’re near Puffs Island now! It’s pandemonium here, too! Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:42.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon and Bege finally dropped off the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:47.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake is on Puffs Island! Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:50.89,Main,,0,0,0,,In just a few minutes, this'll all be over!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if that cake is laced with deadly poison,Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,there's no way for us to stop her anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:06.57,Main,,0,0,0,,There are three possible outcomes!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:10.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Firstly... by eating the poisoned cake,Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama dies!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:24.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Secondly... The poison won't affect Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,but the cake will taste bad!Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuck!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, it won't quell her hunger, and she'll continue destroying the country!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:35.51,Main,,0,0,0,,And thirdly...!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:39.03,Main,,0,0,0,,the poison in the cake doesn't affect her and it tastes good!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It would take a miracle, but it's the only way we can survive!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:45.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The taste of that cake will decide our fates!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:55.16,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the worst situation ever-soir!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:58.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Inform the entire country!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,They already know.Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.75,0:19:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is out of control right now...Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:05.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that Nuts Island was completely devastated.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.35,0:19:06.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen to Totto Land?Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:13.49,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just like playing Russian roulette with this cake-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:18.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where did Morgans and Stussy go?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.48,Main,,0,0,0,,They left the island a while ago...Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.77,0:19:23.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Capture them!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,If the worst result happens, the news will leak to the outside world!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:29.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:36.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure that journalist doesn't leave this country at all costs!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He could publish anything!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:42.87,Main,,0,0,0,,This island is doomed! Let's get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:47.21,Captions,,0,0,10,,Floofy Town - Puffs IslandDialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's gonna destroy it just like Nuts Island!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon-sama was brainwashed by the traitor, Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon! What are you saying?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I’m doing this because I believe in the cake Black Leg made.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know where he learned to cook...Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:13.11,Main,,0,0,0,,but his culinary skills surpass even those of the head chef!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.99,0:20:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Vito! Gotti!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:22.59,Main,,0,0,0,,You two go look for a ship to escape on!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll bring Chiffon with me later!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:28.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We paid off our debt to the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We lost our precious ship.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Those damn Straw Hats!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.85,0:20:40.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive them if they die after all we've done for them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:04.60,Main,,0,0,0,,cake!!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:13.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! They're back!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:14.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:15.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:16.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:25.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy! Really!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:30.18,Main,,0,0,0,,He's totally worn out...Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.27,0:21:34.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Well done! Luffy! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:36.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I was so worried, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:38.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:43.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys... You kept me waiting so long!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:48.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy... Did you beat Katakuri?Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:52.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:53.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so impressed, Luffy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:21:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,He fell asleep?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.89,Main,,0,0,0,,His wounds are still fresh...Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.89,0:22:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper-san, attend to his wounds! He's losing too much blood, isn't he?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.98,0:22:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.19,0:22:20.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you too. You got shot!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is nothing.Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:33.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Good! We're finally in range.Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.41,0:22:39.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We didn’t notice them catching up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.36,0:22:43.16,Main,,0,0,0,,We haven't lost them yet! Treat him as we sail away!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:44.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.26,0:23:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.65,0:23:20.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...?Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.35,0:23:29.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa's backing them up!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.45,0:23:31.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Judge!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Should we return fire?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:35.69,Main,,0,0,0,,No, ignore them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa is also fighting the fleet at the harbor!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Aim at Straw Hat's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:42.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.68,0:24:14.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you care so much about him?! Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:19.96,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the territory of the Emperor Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.96,0:24:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You're in a place where escape is impossible once you enter!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.04,0:24:27.51,Main,,0,0,0,,And yet, you risked your life just to take back one person?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.51,0:24:31.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji is Germa's failure!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.86,0:24:35.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He can't use his skin as a shield...Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.54,0:24:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,He cooks because he doesn't have a shred of royal pride!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.21,0:24:45.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.04,0:24:48.84,Main,,0,0,0,,He's an idiot with a soft spot...Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,and a soft mind that makes him put his life on the line for the weak!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.18,0:25:00.93,Main,,0,0,0,,He is truly unfit to be a soldier!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:03.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all he is!Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.10,0:25:11.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Thank you for your help!Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.56,0:25:14.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you answer me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.31,0:25:17.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.92,0:25:23.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised. Why did he suddenly start listing all the good things about you?Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.32,0:25:27.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! He didn't mean it that way!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.11,0:25:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.47,0:25:33.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.63,0:25:42.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! Look ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.19,0:25:43.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.57,0:25:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,No! This is terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.04,0:25:50.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! There's a massive fleet right in front of us!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.63,0:25:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,When did they get here?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:55.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like they finally noticed...Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.99,0:25:58.41,Main,,0,0,0,,There are tons of ships!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.41,0:26:01.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do? We got pincered again!Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:01.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.33,0:26:01.37,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.37,0:26:01.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.41,0:26:01.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.45,0:26:01.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.49,0:26:01.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.53,0:26:01.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:01.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.62,0:26:01.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.66,0:26:01.70,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.70,0:26:01.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.74,0:26:01.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.79,0:26:01.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.83,0:26:01.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.87,0:26:01.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.91,0:26:01.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.95,0:26:01.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.99,0:26:02.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:02.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:02.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.12,0:26:02.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.16,0:26:02.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.20,0:26:02.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.24,0:26:02.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.29,0:26:02.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.33,0:26:02.37,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.37,0:26:02.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.41,0:26:02.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.45,0:26:02.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.49,0:26:02.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:02.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 66Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.58,0:26:02.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,GERMA 