SLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.41,0:26:03.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.45,0:26:03.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.50,0:26:03.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:03.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.58,0:26:03.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.62,0:26:03.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.66,0:26:03.70,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.70,0:26:03.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.75,0:26:03.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.79,0:26:03.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.83,0:26:03.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.87,0:26:03.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.91,0:26:03.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:03.95,0:26:04.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:04.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.04,0:26:04.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.08,0:26:04.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:04.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.16,0:26:04.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.20,0:26:04.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.25,0:26:04.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.29,0:26:04.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.33,0:26:04.37,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.37,0:26:04.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.41,0:26:04.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:04.45,0:26:08.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,CACAO ISLANDDialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,The idle fleet was able to circle around us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.32,0:26:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.97,0:26:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We're already in their firing range!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:13.05,Main,,0,0,0,,How?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.48,0:26:18.64,Main,,0,0,0,,We're coming from both the front and back, rabbit!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:19.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.99,0:26:23.68,Main,,0,0,0,,In front of you, a fleet... behind you, a genie!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.68,0:26:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Genie-uine...Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.43,0:26:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Rage Split!Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.50,0:26:28.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:30.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.76,0:26:34.44,Main,,0,0,0,,He's huge!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You've finally entered the range of my ability!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.62,0:26:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Now it looks like we're bullying them.Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.91,0:26:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,How did they get this close to us so quickly?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.33,0:26:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Look closely at the ships in front of us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.30,0:27:00.24,Main,,0,0,0,,They're all paddle ships!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.59,0:27:02.49,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:04.47,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can escape!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.47,0:27:09.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess this is the end! We were barely able to make it this far, but...Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.69,0:27:11.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Crush them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.79,0:27:20.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.98,0:27:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The surface of the sea is swelling up...Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.56,0:27:34.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive anyone who...Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.56,0:27:40.60,Main,,0,0,0,,gives the boss any trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.21,0:27:46.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.96,0:27:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy... he was a member of Hody's crew on Fishman Island...Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.59,0:27:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Wadatsumi!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.84,0:27:54.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.05,0:27:55.97,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.97,0:27:57.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.86,0:28:04.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.99,0:28:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We came to see you off! Captain Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:16.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's "former"! Former Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Until you get out of Big Mom’s territory, we’re still your crew… all right?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.36,0:28:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I got it!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.63,0:28:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.13,0:28:37.92,Main,,0,0,0,,So cool!Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.26,0:28:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What the?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:43.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It's flooded!Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:48.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone punched holes in the bottom?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:51.48,Main,,0,0,0,,There are Fishmen in the water!Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.48,0:28:53.69,Main,,0,0,0,,How could they be so sneaky?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.69,0:28:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Come out, you damn Fishmen!Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.55,0:29:05.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.21,0:29:10.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.25,0:29:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let the Straw Hats get away!Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.34,0:29:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Genie!Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.63,0:29:20.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Ocean Current...Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.11,0:29:23.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoulder Throw!Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.03,0:29:43.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:49.56,Main,,0,0,0,,A path opened on the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.33,0:30:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Push forward while we hold them off, Captain Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:10.26,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you harm the Straw Hats' ship!Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.14,0:30:18.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I notice?Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.13,0:30:26.98,Main,,0,0,0,,They disabled the enemy's Territorial Sea Slugs for us, too.Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.98,0:30:30.78,Main,,0,0,0,,They ended up helping me to the very end.Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.78,0:30:34.62,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of Jinbe's crew!Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.62,0:30:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.27,0:30:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks...Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.17,0:30:40.12,Main,,0,0,0,,you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care of Jinbe for us! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.96,0:30:46.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.92,0:30:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.64,0:30:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Merge!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.23,0:31:15.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama, shouldn't you be on Cacao Island?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.36,0:31:20.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I left Germa to Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.07,0:31:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,These are heavy-metal composite bullets that can...Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.67,0:31:27.74,Main,,0,0,0,,easily punch holes through Germa's Raid Suits!Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.74,0:31:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Go teach them a lesson!Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.50,0:31:31.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.34,0:31:45.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's that guy again!Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:51.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.94,0:31:58.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you brought down Katakuri, you're the last person...Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.86,0:32:00.82,Main,,0,0,0,,that I'll let leave alive!Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.27,0:32:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen?Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.94,0:32:24.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's gonna be alright!Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.27,0:32:26.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The man who baked it....Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.51,0:32:28.35,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,is a true chef!Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.82,0:32:33.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Wait, Black Leg! Won’t that method take all night?Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:35.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Taking this time is vital.Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.43,0:32:37.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But we don't have time!Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.10,0:32:38.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll do it in two hours!Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.71,0:32:40.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.99,0:32:46.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why are you smiling?! Get serious, Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.02,0:32:51.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Your ship and our country are at stake!Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.95,0:32:54.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.00,0:32:57.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it because...Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.02,0:33:00.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about Big Mom calling this cake "delicious" with a delighted face.Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.08,0:33:02.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,How lovely!Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.47,0:33:03.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Her delighted face?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.83,0:33:06.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that your life is in danger?Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.93,0:33:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.90,0:33:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Did the poison kill her?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:40.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so delicious... that I could die right now!Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.37,0:33:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,The sweetness is unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.46,0:33:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it!Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:55.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.20,0:33:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,She stopped...Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.91,0:34:01.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What about the poison?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.30,0:34:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was in there! It just didn't work! That's our Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.25,0:34:12.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.61,0:34:15.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the look that you wished to see!Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.71,0:34:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,To all islands of Totto Land.Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.23,0:34:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The damage will spread no further!Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.22,0:34:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Because of the efforts of the Charlotte Family's 35th daughter, Pudding...Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.30,0:34:54.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's hunger tantrum has been quelled!Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.18,0:34:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! I thought this island would be next, since we're so close to Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.08,0:35:01.01,Main,,0,0,0,,It was scary!Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.01,0:35:02.61,Main,,0,0,0,,We're okay now!Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:05.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.50,0:35:23.23,Main,,0,0,0,,By using Chiffon-sama, who betrayed the country, Pudding-sama saved Totto Land!Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.23,0:35:24.99,Main,,0,0,0,,No one else could do it!Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.99,0:35:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.52,0:35:30.37,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.37,0:35:31.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.27,0:35:33.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.12,0:35:42.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.18,0:35:54.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Sparking... Figure!Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.32,0:36:04.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Hot Sea Hell!Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, swim deeper into the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.21,0:36:23.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too hot! I can't get near him!Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.44,0:36:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There is no protection for you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.08,0:36:29.47,Main,,0,0,0,,And you have nowhere to run!Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.47,0:36:34.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.47,0:36:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.67,0:36:45.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's...Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.56,0:36:47.79,Main,,0,0,0,,advance!Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.18,0:36:55.12,Main,,0,0,0,,The Queen Mama Chanter will be arriving at Cacao Island soon.Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:03.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Just in time!Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.23,0:39:18.98,Captions,,0,0,660,,Happy Birthday LinlinDialogue: 0,0:39:20.52,0:39:32.79,Captions,,0,0,660,,Happy Birthday LinlinDialogue: 0,0:39:29.99,0:39:32.79,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday!Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.79,0:39:35.08,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.08,0:41:27.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: KaitouYahiko  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi KaitouYahiko  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll GaijinDialogue: 0,0:41:21.63